{
  "sn3.12:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 3.12 ",
  "sn3.12:0.2": "2. Dutiyavagga ",
  "sn3.12:0.3": "Pañcarājasutta ",
  "sn3.12:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn3.12:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena pañcannaṁ rājūnaṁ pasenadipamukhānaṁ pañcahi kāmaguṇehi samappitānaṁ samaṅgībhūtānaṁ paricārayamānānaṁ ayamantarākathā udapādi: ",
  "sn3.12:1.3": "“kiṁ nu kho kāmānaṁ aggan”ti? ",
  "sn3.12:1.4": "Tatrekacce evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "sn3.12:1.5": "“rūpā kāmānaṁ aggan”ti. ",
  "sn3.12:1.6": "Ekacce evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "sn3.12:1.7": "“saddā kāmānaṁ aggan”ti. ",
  "sn3.12:1.8": "Ekacce evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "sn3.12:1.9": "“gandhā kāmānaṁ aggan”ti. ",
  "sn3.12:1.10": "Ekacce evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "sn3.12:1.11": "“rasā kāmānaṁ aggan”ti. ",
  "sn3.12:1.12": "Ekacce evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "sn3.12:1.13": "“phoṭṭhabbā kāmānaṁ aggan”ti. ",
  "sn3.12:1.14": "Yato kho te rājāno nāsakkhiṁsu aññamaññaṁ saññāpetuṁ. ",
  "sn3.12:2.1": "Atha kho rājā pasenadi kosalo te rājāno etadavoca: ",
  "sn3.12:2.2": "“āyāma, mārisā, yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamissāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ etamatthaṁ paṭipucchissāma. ",
  "sn3.12:2.3": "Yathā no bhagavā byākarissati tathā naṁ dhāressāmā”ti. ",
  "sn3.12:2.4": "“Evaṁ, mārisā”ti kho te rājāno rañño pasenadissa kosalassa paccassosuṁ. ",
  "sn3.12:3.1": "Atha kho te pañca rājāno pasenadipamukhā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā b